# An empty hand: Bot1 casts three Ornithopters and then the Interpreter, so its hand is empty when "discard your hand"
# resolves; nothing is discarded (the graveyard stays empty) and it still investigates four times. On turn three it
# attacks as a 5/5 with menace (one card in hand after the draw) beside an Ornithopter. Bot2's lone Ornithopter cannot
# block the Interpreter (menace, CR 702.110b - the refusal) but can block Bot1's Ornithopter (the positive control: the
# same blocker on another attacker). The Interpreter connects for five.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Carnage Interpreter
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Plains x14

